<http://www.spektrix.com/chemainustheatrefestivalsociety/event/32201AJKCHKSVHJRMVGRPSJQJNPNNBBBQ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Come From Away";
  schema:description """
	JUN 4 - AUG 22 <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Available to Priority Access Patrons with a 2027 Subscription</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Book, Music and Lyrics by IRENE SANKOFF and DAVID HEIN<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>When 38 planes unexpectedly land in a tiny Newfoundland town on September 11th, 7,000 stranded travelers are met with kindness, resilience and care. Come From Away is packed with vibrant Celtic folk music celebrating hope and connection when everything falls apart.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Come From Away is presented through special arrangement with Music Theatre International (MTI). All authorized performance materials are also supplied by MTI. www.mtishows.com<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Recommended Age: 12+<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">2027 Season On Sale Dates:</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Nov 3</span> – <span class=\"ItalicText\">Priority Access for Super Patrons</span>  </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Nov 12</span> – <span class=\"ItalicText\">Priority Access for Subscription Renewals</span>  </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Dec 1</span> – Subscriptions on sale to the general public </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Jan 5</span> - Single Tickets on sale</li></ul><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Note:</span> Performance dates for the 2027 season may only be booked by eligible patrons purchasing 2027 subscriptions during the Priority Access and subscription sales periods outlined above.</span>
""";
