  schema:description """
	<span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Available to Priority Access Patrons with a 2027 Subscription</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Complete your Chemainus Theatre experience with a <span class=\"BoldText\">pre‑show buffet in our Playbill Dining Room.</span> Enjoy great food, warm hospitality, and live piano entertainment - the perfect start to your theatre outing.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Our chef-curated seasonal buffet includes fresh salads and starters, choice of entrées, and some decadent desserts! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Lunch, brunch, and dinner</span> available on select dates.<span><br/></span>Pair your meal with a beverage from our specialty selection of <span class=\"BoldText\">wines, beers, and estate ciders.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>✨<span class=\"BoldText\">2027 Season On Sale Dates:</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Nov 3</span> – <span class=\"ItalicText\">Priority Access for Super Patrons</span>  </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Nov 12</span> – <span class=\"ItalicText\">Priority Access for Subscription Renewals</span>  </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Dec 1</span> – Subscriptions on sale to the general public </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Jan 5</span> - Single Theatre & Dining Tickets on sale</li></ul><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Note:</span> Dining reservations for the 2027 season are currently available only to eligible patrons purchasing 2027 subscriptions during the subscription sales periods outlined above.</span>
