	NOV 12 - DEC 23<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Available to Priority Access Patrons with a 2027 Subscription</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Charles Dickens, David McGillivray, Walter Zerlin Jr.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Farndale Avenue Housing Estate Townswomen's Dramatic Society's Production of A Christmas Carol By: Charles Dickens, David McGillivray, Walter Zerlin Jr. Get ready for the festive play that goes wrong! A well-meaning but zany theatre troupe tackles Dickens’ classic tale. Brace yourself for a hilarious holiday catastrophe packed with backstage blunders, missed cues, and wild characters as they turn a beloved holiday classic into outrageous live-stage mayhem.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All Ages<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">2027 Season On Sale Dates:</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Nov 3</span> – <span class=\"ItalicText\">Priority Access for Super Patrons</span>  </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Nov 12</span> – <span class=\"ItalicText\">Priority Access for Subscription Renewals</span>  </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Dec 1</span> – Subscriptions on sale to the general public </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Jan 5</span> - Single Tickets on sale</li></ul><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Note:</span> Performance dates for the 2027 season may only be booked by eligible patrons purchasing 2027 subscriptions during the Priority Access and subscription sales periods outlined above.</span>
