  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Murder on the Links";
  schema:description """
	SEP 24 - OCT 24 <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Available to Priority Access Patrons with a 2027 Subscription</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>by Steven Dietz<span><br/></span>Adapted from the novel by Agatha Christie<span><br/></span><span><br/></span> In a follow-up to last year’s hit, Peril in the Alps, Hercule Poirot is back. Something’s afoul on the private golf course at Merlinville-Sur-Mer, as he arrives in France to find his wealthy client murdered! Six versatile actors play through controlled chaos in this mysterious whodunit.   <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Recommended Age: 15+<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">2027 Season On Sale Dates:</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Nov 3</span> – <span class=\"ItalicText\">Priority Access for Super Patrons</span>  </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Nov 12</span> – <span class=\"ItalicText\">Priority Access for Subscription Renewals</span>  </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Dec 1</span> – Subscriptions on sale to the general public </li><li><span class=\"BoldText\">Jan 5</span> - Single Tickets on sale</li></ul><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Note:</span> Performance dates for the 2027 season may only be booked by eligible patrons purchasing 2027 subscriptions during the Priority Access and subscription sales periods outlined above.</span>
